#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:260
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Technically necessary cookies include in particular session and security cookies\n"
"                (such as \"sessionid\" and \"csrftoken\") as well as cookies required for navigation,\n"
"                language selection and consent management (for example \"django_language\",\n"
"                \"htmx-current-path-for-history\" and \"CookieConsent\").\n"
"                Your selected light or dark theme is not stored in a cookie but locally in your\n"
"                browser via localStorage (key \"mentoroai-theme\") and is not transmitted to us.\n"
"                Details on the individual cookies, their purposes, categories and storage periods\n"
"                can be found in our Cookie Policy.\n"
