#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:277
msgid ""
"\n"
"                We use the consent management platform Klaro by KIProtect to obtain and manage legally required\n"
"                cookie consent. Klaro stores cookies that document your consent status and block all non-essential\n"
"                cookies until you consent. The processing is based on our legal obligation under Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""

#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:284
